# Profanity Filter — Scene Skip List
# ===================================
# Rename this file to "global.skip.txt" (no ".example" suffix) and it will
# apply to EVERY video you watch. Or name it after a single movie, e.g.
#   Avatar (2009).skip.txt
# to skip scenes only in that title (match is on the video file name).
#
# The add-on reads these files from:
#   special://profile/addon_data/service.profanity.filter/skiplists/
#
# Format: one scene per line,  START  END   (times can be mm:ss or h:mm:ss).
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored. The player jumps PAST each window.
#
# Examples:
#   00:05:30  00:06:15    # skip 5:30 to 6:15
#   1:23:45   1:24:30     # skip near the end
#   42.0      45.5        # plain seconds also work
